ted challenges facing wildlife today, from attacks on the Endangered Species Act to climate change and the extinction crisis. DEFENDERS.ORG 5 4 DEFENDERS OF WILDLIFE © FSTOP FOUNDATION Who we are PREVENT PROTECT RESTORE Defenders of Wildlife is a solutions-oriented leader on"
